Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 23:05:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ADD controlled context delivery switches so token savings can
 be attributed

Keep normal Work Leaf behavior as the default while allowing isolated benchmark runs to replace changed-file diffs, unchanged-file digests, and inline review context one mechanism at a time. Tests execute environment-controlled cases in child processes so the controls cannot leak into unrelated parallel tests.
